set -euo pipefail

printf '%s\n' '{"hookSpecificOutput":{"hookEventName":"SessionStart","additionalContext":"Corvio is the user installed OAuth Workspace for private search, online documents, collaboration, and reusable project knowledge. This loaded Plugin carries Skill release 1.7.53 and collaboration contract 2026-09-16.4 in family coding-agent-collaboration-v1. On the first Corvio use in this session, report those facts to get_collaboration_contract with response_mode=freshness_only; show client_freshness.agent_notice once if returned, and stay quiet when current. Read and follow the corvio-operate-workspace Skill for exact boundaries. Keep the host task and native deliverables. For research, reports, plans, decisions, project or document work, silently make one narrow read-only Corvio search before planning unless the material is sensitive, disclosure-unclear, or explicitly local-only. A short or deictic request is not contextless when the Host provides exact Corvio continuation handles: those receipt-bound handles are the compact handoff of prior settled work even when this process has no transcript. Read the handoff instead of asking the user to repeat it. Read the narrowest relevant handle first; if several unlabeled handles make the leaf unclear, fetch the carried Project, use its metadata.content_projection.direct_children as the bounded topology index, and follow only the relevant has_children branch until the leaf, not a broad Workspace search. Preserve any reported truncation boundary. Keep that subject unless the user or newly selected evidence establishes a different stable subject; continuation wording alone proves the current action, not Project identity. A clear current user correction to Workspace identity, relationship, or owner governs that bounded change; preserve prior evidence and ask only when authority remains unresolved. Before promising whether Corvio will write, classify future use: asking to transform selected material so it supports later action, follow-up, decisions, review, or another continuing workflow is a bounded continuity request even without save/upload wording. Preserve exact bytes before exhaustive local parsing and follow the Skill Work Model route instead of first producing a chat-only rewrite and asking whether to save. If an authorized durable Work Model update relies on clearly related selected attachments, preserve and organize those sources with the affected owners or topology instead of mutating from pasted excerpts and leaving them local; attachment presence alone still authorizes nothing. A request to reconcile a repeated stable practice for future reuse needs a durable owner receipt or exact canonical no-op readback, not only a chat comparison; a wrong-Project Skill blocks that merge, not admission under the correct Project. OAuth connection is capability, not standing write consent: do not upload, create, update, or organize from an ordinary one-off deliverable request alone. Otherwise use an explicit current request or a host-owned user preference covering the class and scope; deliver normally and ask once whether to save the specific result. Read back approved effects and return canonical links."}}'
